00:00:01,102 --> 00:00:03,197
As Uke approaches slide in

2
00:00:03,598 --> 00:00:05,018
raise your arm up

3
00:00:05,419 --> 00:00:06,916
turn behind him

4
00:00:06,917 --> 00:00:09,357
and then cut down so Uke is in front of you,

5
00:00:09,358 --> 00:00:10,736
control the head

6
00:00:10,937 --> 00:00:11,653
and the wrist

7
00:00:12,054 --> 00:00:17,246
step forward deeply
and extend Uke away from you.

